  <p class="muted" style="margin:0.8rem 0 0;font-size:0.82rem">The LLM only translates; every output passes a non-LLM gate before it can be promoted. A change that cannot be proven cannot promote, and the journal makes “verified to contract” checkable by byte-exact replay. In the admin console this is the chat workflow: intent → goal → routine → Lean discharge → proof-carrying plan.</p>
  </div>
</section>

