    <div class="card">
      <h3>Rules that shape it</h3>
      <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:1.1rem;font-size:0.85rem">
        <li>Harness = proposal, substrate gates = acceptance. Non-formal output stays <span class="mono">Uncertain</span>.</li>
        <li>Agents default to read-only; writes need an operator-owned grant mode.</li>
        <li>An agent cannot choose where prompts go: profiles carry URL, secret and locality, and agent configs cannot set them.</li>
        <li>Hosted apps and bundles are designed (<span class="mono">docs/concepts/apps.md</span>) but not built yet.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
